This deep dive is really for anyone who wants to navigate that whole...

13
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:46,110
Getting ready for a meeting phase with a bit more ease, more confidence, and yeah, more precision.

14
00:00:46,150 --> 00:00:46,730
Sounds essential.

15
